{"lines":[{"y":0.059142630207862146,"c":1,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","w":0.32143084208170569,"x":0.61086852869301067,"h":0.021307465606078324},{"x":0.088477361354417444,"h":0.023372230035537012,"c":1,"y":0.10453474690499442,"t":"TEST 5, WRITING TASK 2","w":0.36419754028320306},{"w":0.20781892140706379,"y":0.14098837232351202,"x":0.088477368617455782,"c":1,"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER","h":0.017441859655301539},{"x":0.088331276015639545,"h":0.023423600393414401,"c":1,"y":0.17650229377911386,"w":0.80685297648111998,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score. Here is the"},{"w":0.20987654368082681,"h":0.019140164899882239,"c":1,"x":0.088477365696329691,"t":"examiner's comment:","y":0.1946407539542967},{"y":0.23110465155108473,"t":"The candidate addresses all parts of the prompt, although there is some","x":0.13374485301335579,"h":0.018895348053517669,"c":1,"w":0.68518519083658846},{"x":0.13358440790812645,"w":0.70199127197265632,"h":0.02444204368636238,"y":0.24619716958955951,"c":1,"t":"misunderstanding of the term shared freely. Ideas relating to each sector"},{"h":0.020329797787436155,"y":0.26713363186203942,"w":0.73473622639973968,"x":0.13366264503987801,"c":1,"t":"mentioned in the prompt are presented, yet there is not much development of"},{"x":0.13168724989902841,"y":0.28474676047110981,"w":0.75308639526367194,"c":1,"h":0.019140164899882128,"t":"these, especially of sharing ideas in the business world. There is a clear overall"},{"w":0.73058344523111973,"h":0.01983715816717968,"t":"progression, with the candidate's own opinion presented at the end, but there","x":0.13368394912808082,"c":1,"y":0.30307150605526889},{"y":0.31930191508382433,"t":"are some errors in the use of cohesive devices [working there on out of this |","x":0.13153745177077289,"c":1,"w":0.726719970703125,"h":0.023789768645844811},{"t":"which scientist]. Lexis is mainly appropriate for the task, though there are some","x":0.13157230951441362,"y":0.3382592239249631,"c":1,"w":0.7512711079915364,"h":0.021191913753010772},{"h":0.019038621612656681,"w":0.69153406778971349,"t":"errors in word choice [actual | releases] and spelling [govenment | limite |","x":0.13161158459045813,"y":0.35699118262758556,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.1315283551455865,"w":0.75747751871744806,"y":0.37419494659702957,"h":0.021707768434630181,"t":"theme | loose]. There is a mix of simple and complex sentence forms, with a fair"},{"y":0.39258609899943431,"x":0.13160598997259504,"w":0.75530242919921875,"c":1,"h":0.019339371626172053,"t":"degree of accuracy: errors in grammatical control seldom prevent meaning from"},{"w":0.15637860616048174,"h":0.015988372380376759,"c":1,"y":0.41133720913513661,"x":0.13168724012358388,"t":"coming through."},{"x":0.086347510160843133,"t":"Sharing information is actual issue in our world where it has strong influence on people.","h":0.018555122213734343,"y":0.44704562931206437,"w":0.83142094930013011,"c":1},{"x":0.082241370418237897,"c":1,"y":0.46417653523059133,"w":0.80054148356119803,"t":"There are various spheres of our life where information is more or less important for","h":0.017231604235753539},{"x":0.084285664518400458,"y":0.48092471858318731,"h":0.019480364903965652,"w":0.80054768880208327,"t":"people working there on out of this. For this reason some people consider that it is","c":1},{"x":0.082237990146004927,"t":"good to share information while others think in opposite way.","y":0.5004758506785596,"w":0.59479543050130201,"h":0.019925232068388699,"c":1},{"t":"For example, practically all scientists are glad to share information with ordinary people","w":0.83333333333333348,"c":1,"h":0.018895348053517669,"x":0.08436213976450925,"y":0.52325581434186075},{"t":"or okher scientist. There is no competition in this sphere. Sometimes it is bad for","c":1,"h":0.016557822659945098,"w":0.80465525309244801,"x":0.082246457010166876,"y":0.54016744644729231},{"c":1,"t":"govenment which scienkist share the secret information with international spy but it","x":0.080155005510886029,"y":0.55636148150827225,"h":0.022451546784705401,"w":0.82119445800781243},{"x":0.080246918998092415,"c":1,"w":0.24485595703124999,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.57558139509709794,"t":"will not hurt information."},{"x":0.0823045256608151,"t":"There are some simple rules in academic world which limite informational sources between","w":0.83950617472330724,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"y":0.59883720918249295},{"c":1,"w":0.82536702473958334,"t":"people. If person is interested in kheme discussing with you and you are ready to keep","y":0.61407531501569279,"x":0.082171338100027733,"h":0.022014680824234856},{"y":0.63368669048065496,"h":0.016022611984234936,"x":0.082304536572158984,"t":"talking then the person gives you all information what he knows for free. On the other","c":1,"w":0.82304524739583329},{"w":0.78629882812500007,"t":"hand, if the person knows much and he knows that you can not give him actual or","x":0.08008763853950901,"h":0.022025938449675486,"y":0.64918703295590108,"c":1},{"x":0.07805056760437698,"y":0.66640636782673934,"w":0.81514923095703118,"t":"new information then he will share information with you just for money. For example,","h":0.024397903954603617,"c":1},{"x":0.080246909099077848,"t":"student pay for his learning while two students can cooperate and share information","w":0.80246912638346357,"y":0.68604651174211662,"h":0.01744185965530165,"c":1},{"w":0.83978230794270825,"t":"with each other. It is obviously that sharing information in business world can followes","x":0.080106083078471974,"y":0.70246303548345823,"c":1,"h":0.022798470810529659},{"w":0.79835393269856769,"h":0.016032884483202614,"y":0.72379269704828131,"t":"by releases. There is large competition and it may takes much costs for companies.","x":0.080246901695595438,"c":1},{"w":0.81924911499023423,"c":1,"t":"Companies loose their profit every day because some one can not Keep silence especially","x":0.082156440174809123,"h":0.020991852202039252,"y":0.73924203542416589},{"y":0.75827685364267949,"c":1,"w":0.13858605702718099,"x":0.077863492732835909,"t":"IT companies.","h":0.016281569383169603},{"y":0.7768748034198304,"h":0.02484094914053292,"t":"To sum up all above it is neccessery to say that there are some spheres in which","w":0.784396514892578,"c":1,"x":0.079979150957439529},{"x":0.080164568638811981,"y":0.79767446944509446,"h":0.020023098823178986,"w":0.80878712972005218,"t":"sharing information is a crime. In my opinion, in many cases information can be too","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.07818930251246177,"h":0.016005492463128657,"y":0.81684334488044552,"w":0.26337448120117191,"t":"important or sharing at all."},{"y":0.9360465114545421,"w":0.037037035624186143,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"125","x":0.87860082365486392},{"w":0.20824633280436194,"h":0.016454192297478354,"c":1,"y":0.96768258536995222,"x":0.39483721299237268,"t":"leltsresources.org"}],"w":2400,"h":3395}